flowchart LR
    I[Typed input] --> A[QAgents agent]
    M[Offline fixture or configured model] --> A
    A --> T[Tools and specialists]
    T --> P{Approval decision}
    P -->|Approved| D[Local destination]
    P -->|Declined| R[Recorded refusal]
    T --> V[Application verifier]
    D --> V
    R --> V
    V --> O[Report and artifacts]
